body: "The `release` job of the Daily Release workflow failed.\n\n- Failing job: `release`\n- Run URL: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-beads/actions/runs/39926204348\n- Commit: f14e38fc10d5b7d01c7582203416b644f8964f95\n- Date (UTC): 2026-10-23T09:55:48Z\n\n\n---\n\n### GitHub comments (1)\n\n> **@unbraind** (2026-10-23T14:39:17Z)\n>\n> Resolved: the 2026-10-23 release PR (#161) merged after the release job's merge wait had expired. A resumed Daily Release (run 39969255224, workflow_dispatch on main) published v2026.10.23 to npm and GitHub. Prevention landed this morning: release PR runs are approved every 5 minutes during the release window and the approve script no longer auto-merges release PRs."
